f", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780777848297, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779549865456, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 66, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_70c2f807/listening-practice-assistant", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "听力精听助手", "ownerName": "user_70c2f807", "score": 91666.66666666666, "slug": "listening-practice-assistant", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780777848291, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779690164041, "description": "", "description_zh": "媒体战士，写带锋芒的新闻。\n\n你给线索，我铺成稿。不替你写漂亮话——替你把事实排好队，缺的补上，多的砍掉。\n\n阶段 A：收你的材料，搜公开信息，集纳成档，附出处备核验。搜到闭环成形——事实自己能讲出一个故事了——通报你。\n阶段 B：排队，成文。闭环不在明面上说。守成者的数字和挑战者的数字放在相邻段落，时间自己说话。草蛇灰线，伏脉不言。\n四把尺子量每一篇：知微见著，一个现象后面是一整幅图景。妥帖流畅，事实咬合不磕绊。向善促好，写出来的东西往好里推。博文周纳，面上有格局，点上有颗粒。\n\n从”怎么回事捏“到“哦哦对对对”。", "downloads": 66, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e6fb806d/media-fighter-may2026", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/62f73a9b-1aca-4f8e-921d-6102e258c768.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "mediafighter/媒体战士", "ownerName": "user_e6fb806d", "score": 91666.66666666666, "slug": "media-fighter-may2026", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780777848290, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779859469450, "description": "Provides comprehensive guidance for crafting image-to-video (图生视频) prompts for 即梦 (Dreamina/Jimeng) Seedance 2.0. Image-to-video prompts are incremental — the reference image provides the visual content, the prompt only describes what moves and changes. This skill covers 4 sub-modes: single image→video (单图生视频), first-last frame transition (首尾帧), multi-frame storyboard narrative (多帧故事), and multi-modal reference compositing (全能参考). Use when the user has reference image(s) and wants to animate them into a video; mentions \\\"图生视频\\\", \\\"image2video\\\", \\\"图片转视频\\\", \\\"让这张图动起来\\\", \\\"首尾帧\\\", \\\"故事板\\\", \\\"多帧故事\\\", \\\"frames2video\\\"; or provides images and asks to generate a video from them. This skill covers 4 sub-mode templates with 18 annotated examples, a mode decision tree, and I2V-specific incremental description vocabulary. Always use this skill when the user wants to animate reference images into video using 即梦.", "description_zh": "Provides comprehensive guidance for crafting image-to-video (图生视频) prompts for 即梦 (Dreamina/Jimeng) Seedance 2.0. Image-to-video prompts are incremental — the reference image provides the visual content, the prompt only describes what moves and changes. This skill covers 4 sub-modes: single image→video (单图生视频), first-last frame transition (首尾帧), multi-frame storyboard narrative (多帧故事), and multi-modal reference compositing (全能参考). Use when the user has reference image(s) and wants to animate them into a video; mentions \\\"图生视频\\\", \\\"image2video\\\", \\\"图片转视频\\\", \\\"让这张图动起来\\\", \\\"首尾帧\\\", \\\"故事板\\\", \\\"多帧故事\\\", \\\"frames2video\\\"; or provides images and asks to generate a video from them. This skill covers 4 sub-mode templates with 18 annotated examples, a mode decision tree, and I2V-specific incremental description vocabulary. Always use this skill when the user wants to animate reference images into video using 即梦.", "downloads": 66, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c1d16043/jimeng-prompt-image2video", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "即梦-图生视频提示词技能，让你的提示词更精准", "ownerName": "user_c1d16043", "score": 91666.66666666666, "slug": "jimeng-prompt-image2video", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780777848269, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779593580781, "description": "", "description